== CANON-20 / ADR-0008: `..` is non-associative. A range has exactly two
== bounds, so `A..B..C` is a parse error.
Module Diagnostics.RangeNonAssociative

Main :
    X Bool := 4 in 1..5..9
    PutLn(X)
;
